$ KAVACH_FAKE_GPUS=Intel-UHD-770:0x8086:integrated:dx12;AMD-Radeon-RX-7900:0x1002:discrete:vulkan kavach run src/main.kav
2 GPUs
AMD-Radeon-RX-7900, made by AMD, through vulkan
Intel-UHD-770, made by Intel, through dx12
the first is discrete: use it for the heavy work
$ KAVACH_FAKE_GPUS=Intel-UHD-770:0x8086:integrated:dx12;AMD-Radeon-RX-7900:0x1002:discrete:vulkan kavach run --native src/main.kav
2 GPUs
AMD-Radeon-RX-7900, made by AMD, through vulkan
Intel-UHD-770, made by Intel, through dx12
the first is discrete: use it for the heavy work
